            0.093,
            0.303,
            0.108
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "8. 酪氨酸激酶受体"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.111,
            0.442,
            0.127
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "四.选择题（每小题一分，共11分）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.13,
            0.61,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": "1. 框移突变（frame-shift mutation）可能是基因编码顺序:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.148,
            0.328,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "A.缺失一个碱基的突变"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.452,
            0.149,
            0.665,
            0.163
          ],
          "content": "B. 连续缺失三个碱基的突变"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.167,
            0.221,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": "C. 点突变"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.426,
            0.167,
            0.641,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": "D. 连续插入三个碱基的突变"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.186,
            0.416,
            0.2
          ],
          "content": "2. RNA 分子中的发卡结构是 DNA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.204,
            0.363,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": "A. 串联重复顺序的转录产物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.459,
            0.204,
            0.672,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": "B.镜像重复顺序的转录产物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.223,
            0.362,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": "C.颠倒重复顺序的转录产物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.459,
            0.223,
            0.62,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": "D.随机顺序转录产物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.241,
            0.338,
            0.256
          ],
          "content": "3. 逆转录病毒基因组是"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.26,
            0.298,
            0.275
          ],
          "content": "A. 负单链 RNA 分子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.444,
            0.26,
            0.574,
            0.274
          ],
          "content": "B. 双链 RNA 分子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.278,
            0.281,
            0.293
          ],
          "content": "C. 单链 DNA 分子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.278,
            0.588,
            0.293
          ],
          "content": "D. 正单链 RNA 分子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.296,
            0.777,
            0.312
          ],
          "content": "4. 蛋白质生物合成中，反密码子第一位是 I 的 tRNA 分子，可以阅读 mRNA 上的"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.315,
            0.256,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": "A.一种密码子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.433,
            0.316,
            0.538,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": "B.两种密码子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.334,
            0.255,
            0.348
          ],
          "content": "C.三种密码子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.433,
            0.334,
            0.54,
            0.348
          ],
          "content": "D. 四种密码子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.352,
            0.426,
            0.367
          ],
          "content": "5. 下列事件中与基因表达无关的是"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.371,
            0.239,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": "A. 转录过程"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.427,
            0.371,
            0.515,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": "B. 翻译过程"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.389,
            0.276,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": "C.RNA 剪接过程"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.433,
            0.389,
            0.632,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": "D.DNA 碱基切割修复过程"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.408,
            0.426,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": "6. 非竞争性抑制剂具下列哪种特点"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.427,
            0.307,
            0.442
          ],
          "content": "A.Km 不变，Vmax ↓"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.457,
            0.427,
            0.619,
            0.442
          ],
          "content": "B. Km 不变，Vmax ↑"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.445,
            0.317,
            0.459
          ],
          "content": "C. Km ↑, Vmax 不变"
