          "bbox": [
            0.541,
            0.483,
            0.608,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": "D. LDH5"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.5,
            0.48,
            0.516
          ],
          "content": "8. 下列哪种情况下，尿素循环水平会升高"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.519,
            0.256,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "A. 正常膳食后"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.433,
            0.52,
            0.538,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": "B.高脂膳食后"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.538,
            0.326,
            0.552
          ],
          "content": "C. 高碳水化合物膳食后"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.453,
            0.538,
            0.56,
            0.552
          ],
          "content": "D.严重饥饿后"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.556,
            0.568,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": "9. 当反应速度为最大反应速度的 $80\\%$ 时, $\\mathrm{Km}$ 值等于"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
